KONOHAGAKURE — ROOT (NE) OPERATIVE LIST
CLASSIFICATION: S-RANK SECRET. EYES ONLY.

Root (Ne) is the disbanded-on-paper black-operations foundation formerly directed by Shimura Danzo, operating in the shadows of ANBU. Operatives are conditioned to suppress emotion and name; identities are deliberately obscured.

Designation / Operative | Notes
------------------------|--------------------------------------------------
Director: Shimura Danzo | Councilman; "Darkness of the Shinobi"
Sai (given codename)    | Emotion-suppressed operative; painting/ink techniques
(numbered operatives)   | Identities sealed; cursed silencing seal on the tongue prevents disclosure of Root secrets

Warning: Root's existence, membership, and operations are officially denied. Root members bear a seal that inflicts paralysis if they attempt to speak of the organization. Handling of this file is restricted to the Hokage and designated council members.
